WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:24.430
All right, everybody.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.100
The battle between Domon
Kasshu and his brother, Kyoji...

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.560
...appears to have come to an end.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.240
Domon had dealt a final blow
to the Devil Gundam.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:42.450
But Master became a vicious
demon and still stands in his way.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.500
The opening ceremonies
will start in a few hours.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:53.750
Will Domon make it to the
Final Battle in Neo Hong Kong?

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:58.840
And what of that mysterious capsule
which was headed toward Domon?

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.510
And now!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:05.720
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:11.770
Bright New Star!
The Birth of the God Gundam

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:40.380
Dad, I finally defeated
the Devil Gundam.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:46.260
What's that?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.200
<i>All you people</i>
<i>from around the world!</i>

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.490
<i>Take a look at the ex citement</i>
<i>in this city of Neo Hong Kong</i>.

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:08.620
<i>The opening ceremonies for the Final</i>
<i>Battle are only four hours away</i>.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:12.080
<i>You can feel the electricity</i>
<i>in the air reaching its peak</i>.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:16.460
<i>Fighters are arriving in Neo</i>
<i>Hong Kong, one after another</i>.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:21.550
<i>For the past eleven months, they</i>
<i>have fought to make it this far</i>.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.060
<i>And here, over at Keitoku Airport</i>...

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:33.020
...<i>we are also seeing the arrival</i>
<i>of representatives from all over</i>.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.520
Somehow I made it here
in time!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.070
There they are!

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:46.320
These Gundams have come all
this way just to be beaten by me!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.120
What the...?!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:52.830
Sorry to keep you!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.840
And it looks like I slid in
just in the nick of time.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.300
Hey! Kid!

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.590
What?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.380
Glad to see you made it!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.010
Well, if it's not Chibodee!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.180
What took the two of you
so long to get here?

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.720
That's Neo France's airship.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:10.810
It's George!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:17.610
I'm afraid the tea prepared
for the two of you has gone cold.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.820
I see you brought your
sarcasm along with you!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.530
By the way...

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.490
...Neo Japan's shuttle just arrived
a few moments ago.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:26.530
Say what?!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.280
Then does that mean Bro's here?

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.620
No.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.700
The shuttle arrived
from the Colony.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.290
The Shuffle insignia
is hurting like crazy.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.000
Could this mean Bro's still
in the Guyana Highlands?

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.500
Could this also mean
he's still fighting?

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.010
Against the Devil Gundam?

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.970
There are only three hours left
before the official deadline!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.140
What in the world's going on?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.810
Are you sure that Domon's
received the God Gundam?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.690
I'm sure he's heading here
as we speak.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.290
It's the folks from Neo Russia.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:03.570
That's...!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.490
Domon!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.420
Hurry up, or else the Final Battle
will begin without you.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.990
Rain Mikamura!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.750
Judging from the expression on your
face, I take it he hasn't arrived.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:17.960
No.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.020
So, the assistance Neo Russia
gave you...

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.420
...hasn't made a difference.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.340
It did.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.000
He'll be here.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.630
I'm sure of it.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.220
Argo.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.510
Even you're saying
such nonsense?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.720
Rain!

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:32.970
Rain!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:33.770
Father!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.640
I'm glad you're okay, Rain.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.350
Yes...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.390
...but Domon's still...

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:39.730
Dr. Mikamura...

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.690
...I presume?

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.900
I look forward to our
upcoming match in the Finals.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.860
Argo.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.240
Get Bolt Gundam.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.990
We're off to the
opening ceremonies!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:53.120
I have faith in him.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.500
Argo Gulskii from Neo Russia.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.870
I expect he'll be a tough challenge
for Domon.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.500
Domon.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.420
You have to hurry up, Domon.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.930
That capsule belongs
to Neo Japan.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.560
But what's it doing here?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.610
H-hey, that's...!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:31.570
I'm sure of it!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.240
It's the new Gundam specially
made for the Final Battle!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:38.660
Oh, no.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.120
This side is collapsing, too.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.130
What's going on?!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.840
Domon!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.510
You're not going anywhere!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.720
Did you think I'd let you
leave here in one piece?

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.680
You're such a foolish pupil!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.440
How can you still fight
with that Gundam?!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.400
Of course I can!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.480
Have you already forgotten
my name?

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.400
I'm Undefeated of the East...

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.030
...which means I've never
experienced defeat!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.530
That's right. And I'll stake
my name...

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.910
...and never let you get away!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.170
Give it up!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.960
You don't have a
chance against me!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:27.290
That's nonsense.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.960
You're only my pupil.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.270
What's this about?

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.170
Why do you insist on
fighting me all the way?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.070
Why do you have to defeat me?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.730
Shut up!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.990
You wouldn't understand
how I feel!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:55.160
Why do I fight?!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.780
What good would it do
to explain it to you?!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:09.260
What a sad turn of events.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:12.820
All that hard work in
bringing you up.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.680
I never thought my own pupil
would be fighting against me.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.140
That's right.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.270
If only... If only...

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:27.290
If only you hadn't appeared at
Shinjuku, it would've gone well.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.610
M-Master...

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.780
If only you hadn't become
a Gundam Fighter...

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.530
...it would have gone well.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:36.780
Don't you understand?!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.580
You're a fool!
You're a fool!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.870
You fool!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.210
With the Devil Gundam...

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:50.590
...I was so close to having
the entire world in my grasp!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.880
I had the entire world...!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:53.840
Shut your mouth!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.090
I don't have time for you!

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.760
I'm not your pupil
for the rest of my life...

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.270
...and I'm not your toy!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:05.690
If you have something to tell me,
then say it loud and clear!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.360
Y-you!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.030
Domon!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.490
Master!

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.000
Damn.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.050
My energy level's gone
right down to zero.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.050
I'm finished unless I do something.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:39.720
Then...

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.890
I see you're not able to move.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.860
He jumped out of his Gundam
without arming himself.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.650
Whatever that is,
he's trying to get into it.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.200
You were saying just
a little while ago...

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:03.410
...that I should tell you
what I have to say.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.770
Then I'll spell it out for you.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.120
Right!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.500
This'll help to explain why
you're short on brains!

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.550
Time to say goodbye,
Domon!

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.090
What?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.350
Don't tell me.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.270
He programmed it with the energy
remaining in the Core Lander.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:31.150
So he read my move.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.660
Shining Gundam...

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.200
But now...

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.960
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.180
So, this...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.680
...must be the new Gundam.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.140
Domon!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.690
D-Domon...

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.150
Don't assume you'll be riding
in your new Gundam.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:21.070
I'll show you myself that
things don't always...

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.660
...go as easily as one expects.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.620
Take that!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.550
<i>We're fast approaching the deadline</i>.

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:47.510
<i>Each of these proud Gundams</i>
<i>has come</i>...

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:50.020
...<i>having survived the Fights</i>
<i>of the past 11 months</i>.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:55.400
<i>How many more Gundams will be</i>
<i>arriving before the deadline?</i>

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:58.900
Why is Neo Japan taking his time?

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.530
Do you think he was defeated
by the Devil Gundam?

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.950
I highly doubt it.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.240
I know he will arrive here in time.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.790
Imagine that. The four of us
so worried about an opponent.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.040
You'd think we had
a soft spot for him.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.460
You've got that right!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.130
There's only an hour left.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.630
Do you really think he'll make it?

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:28.180
I know the new machine has
arrived in the Guyana Highlands.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:29.470
So...

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.140
I've received a response!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.270
Domon!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.470
There's a vital response
from God Gundam!

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:37.360
This would mean someone has
gotten into the Gundam.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.230
Domon!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.440
I'm sure it's Domon!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.190
Answer me, Domon.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:42.740
Hey, Domon?

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.450
Domon! Answer me, Domon!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.790
It should have the same system
as the other one.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.380
Why won't you move?!
Come on, new Gundam!

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:07.970
You just won't give up!

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:10.720
Come out, Domon!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.180
Let's settle this with our fists!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.280
Yes.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.940
Why rely on the help of machinery?!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.190
Come on out!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.830
If you are a true martial artist...

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.280
...come out and face me!

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.280
Yes!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.200
Come on out!
Come on out!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:34.370
Let's determine a winner,
once and for all!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.330
No way!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.120
I will...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.290
...I will go to Neo Hong Kong...

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.380
...with this Gundam...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.460
...in order to save my dad!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:47.430
So, please...
So please move for me!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.090
God Gundam!

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.310
Listen, Rain.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.560
We have no choice...

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:58.650
...but to transfer Shining's
battle data to God Gundam.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:13:59.730
What's that?

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.360
It's a brain wave communicator.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.280
One can transmit one's thoughts...

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.360
...even over great distances.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.950
If we can communicate
with Domon...

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.660
It's still in the development stage...

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:12.910
...so I can't guarantee if it'll work.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.700
This is ridiculous!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.370
All we have to rely on
is something like that?!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.500
You must admit it's our only...

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.210
Father.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.090
Let's begin now.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:27.470
I'm certain you're the only one who
can connect with Domon's heart.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:28.470
Yes.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.220
Expand your senses...

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:34.180
...and try to convey your feelings
through this machine.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:35.930
Yes.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:41.730
Domon.

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.360
Domon. Domon. Domon.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.190
Where are you, Domon?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.990
Please, Domon.
Answer me.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.080
There's no time.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:58.240
The Final Battle is about to begin.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.750
If that happens, you won't
be able to save your father.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.960
No. That's not all.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.510
If you don't make it here
in time...

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:11.590
...all those fights over the past
eleven months won't mean a thing.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:12.800
Yes.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:15.600
The eleven months you
and I went through.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:17.770
Domon!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.020
What's this?

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.190
It's the Shuffle Alliance.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.580
Is Domon ahead of here?

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.490
These are...

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.240
...Domon's memories.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.410
Chibodee...

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:42.580
...and George...

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.250
...Sai Saici...

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.210
...and Argo!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:46.710
As well as...

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:49.960
These are...

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.260
...all people who've been
important to Domon.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.430
That's...!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.600
Did it succeed?

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:02.980
Okay...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.230
...it looks like it's going to work!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.150
Domon!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.150
Rain!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.400
Wh-what?!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.910
Shining Gundam?

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.620
How is it possible?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:25.540
Domon!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.670
Rain!
Could Rain be moving it?

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.340
Domon!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.180
You cannot give up!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.300
Give me your hand.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.970
I'll transfer Shining Gundam's
data over to you.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:41.180
Then, you should be able to move.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.350
I won't allow that.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.980
The self-recovery's too slow.

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.280
Don't give up, Domon.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.360
Everyone's waiting for you
in Neo Hong Kong!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.280
Rain!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:56.780
Please...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.710
The people precious to you
are waiting.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:00.740
Yes.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.540
All those dear to you.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.250
I'm very sorry.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.300
For I've never... I've never...

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:16.680
...I've never thought so dearly
of you as much as I do now.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.260
Rain.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.060
Rain!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.620
Undefeated of the East!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.650
Stay where you are!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.530
What the...?!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:27.040
I'll use the last of my strength
in order to quickly self-recover!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.960
I now challenge you, Domon!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.050
I don't have time to play with you!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:43.180
I am going to Neo Hong Kong!

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:57.110
Shining Gundam...

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:07.040
I'm sorry.
I just don't have time.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.840
Looks like this is my only chance!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.670
By using these ropes...

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:19.840
...I should be able to make it,
even to the other side of the planet!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.840
Go!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.140
That's it!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.610
<i>Two minutes and counting!</i>

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.110
Just what is that guy doing?!

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.990
Don't you worry.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.820
Domon Kasshu will be
here in time!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.580
Neo Hong Kong!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.290
<i>One more minute to go!</i>

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.710
Oh, no!
Time's almost up!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:58.590
Domon...

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:01.130
Could that be him?

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.130
Domon!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:06.970
Looks like I made it.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.270
Are these guys taking part as well?

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.650
Th-these guys!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.400
<i>Now, everyone!</i>

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.660
<i>We will start our countdown</i>
<i>to the opening</i>...

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.940
...<i>of the 13th Gundam Fight</i>
<i>Final Round!</i>

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:29.790
Hurry up!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.080
There's not enough time!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:31.830
Hurry!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.580
Hurry, Domon!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.800
Domon! Domon!
Over here!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:45.720
Rain!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.220
Domon!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:49.180
Rain!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:53.690
Come on!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.440
Bro!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:56.900
Hurry now!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:58.400
Domon!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.110
Rain!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.110
Domon!

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:07.950
Domon...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:09.700
Rain...

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.410
- Hey!
- Bro!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:20.590
Domon...

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:23.720
Rain...

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:30.760
You fool! You fool!

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.270
You fool, Domon!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.080
Don't you know how worried
I was about you?

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:36.600
I...

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:40.610
I'm sorry about that, Rain.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.240
Now, everyone...

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.110
...the Gundam Fight
Final Battle...

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:49.280
...is now officially underway.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:53.550
Which nation will the goddess of
victory smile upon this time?

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:57.040
Who will get their hands
on the winner's crown?

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:01.300
And what were those four balls
of light that attacked Domon?

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:05.260
The stakes have been raised
in the city of Neo Hong Kong.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:06.380
And now!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:09.760
Gundam Fight Final Battle!

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.190
Ready! Go!

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:32.120
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:36.500
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:40.960
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:44.500
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:51.680
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:57.390
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:02.650
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:09.200
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:13.320
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:32.760
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:35.680
The Gundam Fight
Final Battle is about to begin!

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:38.060
The God Gundam has gathered...

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:41.890
...with Gundams from around
the world in Neo Hong Kong!

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:43.940
However...

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:48.150
...present at the Finals are some
highly unexpected participants!

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:50.780
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:54.770
All Fighters Gathered!
The Final Battles Begin!

00:23:53.740 --> 00:24:00.720
All Fighters Gathered!
The Final Battles Begin!

00:23:54.780 --> 00:23:57.740
Ready! Go!
